notes.body:
@geraldcombs   !3453 makes a change to `ui/qt/wireshark_main_window.cpp`.  
Best I can tell, it should also apply to `logwolf_main_window.cpp` but I'm not setup to build and test it.  
Is there a plan to track/merge these kind of changes?

